<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Interior bids weaken.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Interior bids weaken.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat bids were weaker Wednesday at locations in Montana, grain merchadisers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Basis really got hit hard, and the reason I'm hearing is that grain is finally starting to hit the coast, and that's satisfying the demand,&quot; a dealer said.</p>
<p>But some locations closer to Minneapolis and the Pacific Northwest reported no change in basis, meaning bids were up in line with the Minneapolis March contract.</p>
<p>MGE spring wheat closed mostly higher, in part due to renewed export optimism, traders said.  </p>
